{"slug":"Leetcode-684-Redundant-Connection","title":"Leetcode#684. Redundant Connection","date":"2023-10-25","updated":"","tags":["Leetcode","Python","medium","施工中","💡","Depth-First Search","Breadth-First Search","Union Find","Graph"],"categories":["Leetcode"],"cover":"/img/cover/leetcode.jpg","excerpt":"In this problem, a tree is an undirected graph that is connected and has no cycles. You are given a graph that started as a tree with nodes labeled from to , with one additional edge added. The added ","sticky":0,"contentHtml":"<h1 id=\"problem\"><a href=\"#problem\"><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Problem</span></span></code></span></a></h1>\n<p>In this problem, a tree is an <strong>undirected graph</strong> that is connected and has no cycles.</p>\n<p>You are given a graph that started as a tree with <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>n</span></span></code></span> nodes labeled from <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>1</span></span></code></span> to <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>n</span></span></code></span>, with one additional edge added. The added edge has two <strong>different</strong> vertices chosen from <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>1</span></span></code></span> to <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>n</span></span></code></span>, and was not an edge that already existed. The graph is represented as an array <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>edges</span></span></code></span> of length <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>n</span></span></code></span> where <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>edges[i] = [ai, bi]</span></span></code></span> indicates that there is an edge between nodes <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>ai</span></span></code></span> and <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>bi</span></span></code></span> in the graph.</p>\n<p>Return <em>an edge that can be removed so that the resulting graph is a tree of</em> <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>n</span></span></code></span> <em>nodes</em>. If there are multiple answers, return the answer that occurs last in the input.</p>\n<p><strong>Example 1:</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.leetcode.com/uploads/2021/05/02/reduntant1-1-graph.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.leetcode.com/uploads/2021/05/02/reduntant1-1-graph.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Input: edges = [[1,2],[1,3],[2,3]]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>Output: [2,3]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span></code></pre></figure>\n<p><strong>Example 2:</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.leetcode.com/uploads/2021/05/02/reduntant1-2-graph.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.leetcode.com/uploads/2021/05/02/reduntant1-2-graph.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Input: edges = [[1,2],[2,3],[3,4],[1,4],[1,5]]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>Output: [1,4]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span></code></pre></figure>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>n == edges.length</span></span></code></span></li>\n<li><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>3 &#x3C;= n &#x3C;= 1000</span></span></code></span></li>\n<li><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>edges[i].length == 2</span></span></code></span></li>\n<li><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>1 &#x3C;= ai &#x3C; bi &#x3C;= edges.length</span></span></code></span></li>\n<li><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>ai != bi</span></span></code></span></li>\n<li>There are no repeated edges.</li>\n<li>The given graph is connected.</li>\n</ul>\n<h1 id=\"solve\"><a href=\"#solve\"><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Solve</span></span></code></span></a></h1>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">class</span><span style=\"color:#E5C07B\"> Solution</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\"> findRedundantConnection</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E5C07B;font-style:italic\">self</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66;font-style:italic\">edges</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">: List[List[</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">int</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">]]) -> List[</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">int</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">]:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">        n </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(edges)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">        </span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">        parent </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">-</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">1</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">]</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">*</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">( </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">len</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(edges) </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">+</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> )</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">        def</span><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\"> find</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66;font-style:italic\">u</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">):</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> parent[u] </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">==</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">1</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">                return</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> u</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">            </span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\"> find</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(parent[u])</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">        def</span><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\"> union</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66;font-style:italic\">u</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">,</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66;font-style:italic\">v</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">):</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">            u_p </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\"> find</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(u)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">            v_p </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\"> find</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(v)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> u_p </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> v_p:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">                parent[v_p] </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> u_p</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">                return</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> False</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">            else</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">                return</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> True</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">in</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">len</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(edges)):</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\">  union</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">( edges[i][</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">0</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">] , edges[i][</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">1</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">] )  :</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">                return</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> [ edges[i][</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">0</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">] , edges[i][</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">1</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">]   ]</span></span></code></pre></figure>"}